Files: *
Copyright: 2026 gsp670-linux contributors
License: MIT
Comment: This package contains no third-party or proprietary material.
 The upstream EPOS Gaming Suite installer, its binaries, the device firmware,
 USB traffic captures and any decompiled output are not distributed here, and
 are not required to use this software. The optional head-related impulse
 response used by the virtual-surround feature is fetched at run time from the
 upstream HeSuVi project and is not packaged here.
 .
 The protocol documentation describes the observed USB HID interface of the
 device (report framing, opcode numbers, payloads and event names). It
 contains no vendor code, no disassembly and no code addresses from the
 vendor's software.

Files: contrib/easyeffects/*
Copyright: 2026 gsp670-linux contributors
License: MIT
Comment: EasyEffects/LSP plugin parameter presets. These contain only DSP
 parameter values and no vendor data.

